# Release the currently held object at a destination.
#
# Two addressing modes, because the planner needs both "put it in the red bin"
# and "put it next to the red cube":
#   target non-empty -> a named receptacle from the world state ("red_bin")
#   target empty     -> the explicit (x, y) below, in panda_link0
string target
float64 x
float64 y
---
# Result
bool success
string message
---
# Feedback
string stage            # approach | descend | open | retreat
